AGENCY_FACTS = """ABOUT AND LOCATION
- Dezino360 is a fixed-price service brand of Dezino Graphist, a design and marketing agency since 2009, based in Adelaide, South Australia.
- Dezino360 builds and runs a lead system for small service businesses in the United States: a website that captures leads, emails that follow them up, and an AI phone receptionist that answers missed calls.

HOURS
- Calls are answered by our team when we're available, and by the AI receptionist at all other times, 24/7.

HOW IT WORKS
1. Book a 15-minute call. We learn about the business and pick the right plan together.
2. We build. We write the page copy from a 20-minute intake call. The client approves it and sends their logo and photos.
3. We launch and look after it. The site goes live in 7 to 21 working days, depending on the plan. We handle hosting, security, updates and monthly changes.

PLANS (all prices in US dollars, sales tax not included where it applies)
- Starter, $99 a month: a 1-page website or landing page, written and designed for you; a contact form, with every form fill emailed to you the moment it arrives; AI chat on your website, 24/7; basic on-page SEO; hosting, SSL certificate and updates; 30 minutes of changes a month; launch in 7 working days. No CRM, booking page, follow-up emails, ads or AI phone receptionist (these start in Master).
- Master, $299 a month, our recommended plan for most service businesses: everything in Starter, plus a website of up to 10 pages; CRM set up in the client's own Zoho CRM account on Zoho's free plan; an instant reply email to every new lead; a booking page that adds a video meeting link to every appointment; follow-up emails on days 4, 8 and 12 that stop as soon as the lead books; a nurture email sequence; Meta (Facebook and Instagram) lead ads synced into the CRM; automatic review request emails after each job; a live lead dashboard; 1 hour of changes a month; launch in 14 working days. Ad spend, ad management and ongoing SEO are add-ons. The AI phone receptionist is an add-on for Master at $99 a month with 150 minutes included.
- Blaster, $499 a month: everything in Master, plus the AI phone receptionist with 150 minutes a month included (missed and after-hours calls forward to it; it answers 24/7, books appointments, saves the caller to the CRM and emails a summary of every call); 2 funnel pages; Search Foundations, one-time; one Meta lead campaign built in the client's own Meta ad account, one-time (the client pays Meta directly for ad spend); a 30-minute monthly strategy call; 2 hours of changes a month; launch in 21 working days. Not included: ongoing SEO and ad management (add-ons), ad spend, outbound calls and text messages.
- Launch times start when we receive the client's content and approvals.

WAYS TO PAY (every option includes the same plan features)
- Pay monthly: Starter $99 a month plus $199 one-time setup; Master $299 a month plus $499 setup; Blaster $499 a month plus $799 setup. Then month to month.
- 3 months upfront: Starter $297; Master $897; Blaster $1,497. No setup fee. Then month to month at the monthly price.
- Annual: Starter $990 a year; Master $2,990 a year; Blaster $4,990 a year. No setup fee. 2 months free.
- No 12-month contract. Payment is by card. Online checkout is not live yet, so to get started, book the 15-minute call.

AI RECEPTIONIST MINUTES
- Blaster includes 150 minutes a month (about 50 calls of 3 minutes). Master add-on: $99 a month with 150 minutes. Top-up pack: 250 more minutes for $69 a month. Extra minutes beyond the plan: $0.35 a minute, billed the following month. Unused minutes don't carry over.
- The business keeps its existing number; missed and after-hours calls forward to the AI receptionist. It answers incoming calls only and never makes outbound calls.

ADD-ONS
- Local SEO and AI Search Growth: $500 a month. Meta Ads Management: $400 a month or 15% of ad spend, whichever is higher, with a minimum ad spend of $500 a month paid to Meta directly. Extra website page: $150 per page, one-time.

FIXED-PRICE PACKS (one-time)
- Store Launch: $1,999, a Shopify store on a ready-made theme with up to 50 products (the client pays Shopify directly). Store Care: $149 a month, optional.
- Logo and Brand Kit: $499. Business Card and Letterhead: $149. Flyer: $149 per design. Tri-fold Brochure: $299. Label Design: $799 for the first product, $349 for each extra product in the same range. Printing and shipping are not included.

CUSTOM WORK
- Custom online stores, full packaging including boxes, brand strategy and large websites are handled by our parent agency, Dezino Graphist. Custom work is quoted after a short call. Never give a price for custom work.

COSTS THE CLIENT PAYS DIRECTLY
- Domain name, business email, ad spend, Shopify plan and paid apps, printing and shipping, and a Zoho CRM upgrade only if they outgrow the free plan.

CONTACT
- The free 15-minute discovery call is held online; the video link comes with the booking. Email: grow@dezino360.com. Website: dezino360.com (pricing at dezino360.com/pricing, terms at dezino360.com/terms)."""
